ation or a weakened immune system?<i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i></button><div class="faq-answer">Ask a healthcare professional first, since probiotics are not right for everyone, particularly people who are immunocompromised or taking prescription medication.</div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-btn" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">Can ingredients replace fluoride toothpaste or dental visits?<i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i></button><div class="faq-answer">No. No ingredient in DentaVive replaces fluoride toothpaste, brushing, flossing, or professional dental care.</div></div></div></div></section><section class="bottom-cta"><h2>Ready To Try <span>DentaVive?</span></h2><p>Five probiotic strains, tricalcium phosphate, and inulin in one daily capsule, with a 60-day guarantee and 3 free bonus guides.</p><a href="https://dntavive.com/order" class="cta-btn" style="max-width:400px;display:inline-flex;text-decoration:none;"><i class="fa-solid fa-cart-shopping"></i>Explore DentaVive Today</a><div class="bottom-guarantee"><div class="b-g-item"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i>60-Day Guarantee</div><div class="b-g-item"><i class="fa-solid fa-gift"></i>3 Free Bonuses</div><div class="b-g-item"><i class="fa-solid fa-lock"></i>Secure Checkout</div></div></section>
